  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato in half.\n• Place potato on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Arrange cut-side down and roast until crisp and tender, 40-45 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-663a108eb2c9c69959bb1d8e-c27898a1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-663a108eb2c9c69959bb1d8e-b4ca2011.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and half the garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small heatproof bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-663a108eb2c9c69959bb1d8e-7476d5e9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potatoes have 5 minutes remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook chickpeas, chermoula spice blend, tomato paste and remaining garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in the water, brown sugar, butter and vegetable stock powder, until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes. Lightly crush with a fork. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-663a108eb2c9c69959bb1d8e-605d7c44.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine golden goddess dressing, mixed salad leaves, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-663a108eb2c9c69959bb1d8e-d916cfc3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide jacket potatoes and garden salad between plates.\n• Top potatoes with smashed chermoula chickpeas, Cheddar cheese and garlic yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-663a108eb2c9c69959bb1d8e-9dcd0658.jpeg"
    }
  ]
